{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53639","headline":"偈 二 · 智常","name":"偈 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牛皮靸（《五灯会元》作「鞔」）露柱，露柱啾啾叫。\n凡耳听不闻，诸圣呵呵笑。\n（《景德传灯录》卷七、《五灯会元》卷三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}